{"n": 1292, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1292.webp", "text": "71-11\n\nUnscrew nut (1) and remove with\nwasher (2).\n\nMark position of steering wheel to\nsteering spindle.\n\nimportant!\n\nThe steering wheel can only be pulled\noff after unlocking the steering.\n\nTake off steering wheel.\n\nReplace self-locking nut.\n\nTightening torque: 70 to 85 Nm (51 to\n61 ft. Ibs.)\n\nBe careful not to damage the turn\nsignal self-cancelling cams.\n\nRemove dashboard trim panel at\nbottom.\n\nUnscrew screws (1 ... 4).\nRemove lower steering column casing\nsection.\n\nInsert light bulb in socket of additional\nelectric lead.\n\nInsert socket In holder for additional\nturn signal Indicator on the instrument\ncarrier (instrument carrier was removed\nfor better understanding).\n\nRoute additional electric lead tothe\nsteering column,\n\n=i Route additional electric lead to the\n\nsteering column.\n\nUnscrew screw (1).\n\nMount the ground connection (brown)\nof the additional wire harness.\n\nExchange the flashing relay.\n\nInsert additional electric lead (2) in\nplug receptacle no. 4.\n\nUnscrew screws of central locking\nmechanism and route the additional\nwire harness along the standard wire\nharness.to the tail lights.", "words": [["71-11", 0.4702, 0.0364, 0.5319, 0.0615], ["Unscrew", 0.2735, 0.0761, 0.32, 0.0866], ["nut", 0.3241, 0.0761, 0.3402, 0.0866], ["(1)", 0.3443, 0.0761, 0.3574, 0.0893], ["and", 0.3615, 0.0747, 0.3807, 0.0866], ["remove", 0.3847, 0.0774, 0.4247, 0.0866], ["with", 0.4287, 0.0747, 0.4499, 0.0853], ["washer", 0.2735, 0.0919, 0.3119, 0.1045], ["(2).", 0.315, 0.0919, 0.3311, 0.1058], ["Mark", 0.2735, 0.1098, 0.2988, 0.123], ["position", 0.3028, 0.1098, 0.3463, 0.123], ["of", 0.3493, 0.1085, 0.3595, 0.1204], ["steering", 0.3645, 0.1085, 0.407, 0.123], ["wheel", 0.411, 0.1085, 0.4408, 0.119], ["to", 0.4459, 0.1098, 0.456, 0.119], ["steering", 0.2735, 0.1257, 0.317, 0.1402], ["spindle.", 0.32, 0.1257, 0.3615, 0.1402], ["important!", 0.2745, 0.1429, 0.3251, 0.1